{"id":"630844","name":"三丁炒米饭","author":"筠旸JY","authorId":"7345450","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630844/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"剩米饭","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"菜笋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黄椒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胡萝卜黄椒笋均切成小丁，香葱切碎。","img":"images/630844/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剩米饭一碗。","img":"images/630844/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅内放油烧热然后放入胡萝卜笋丁煸炒均匀。","img":"images/630844/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入米饭，用铲子按压，炒散。","img":"images/630844/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入黄椒粒和香葱碎。","img":"images/630844/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"继续翻炒均匀。","img":"images/630844/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加少许盐调味。","img":"images/630844/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加少许生抽调味。","img":"images/630844/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"继续翻炒几下就可以关火啦！","img":"images/630844/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/630844/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/630844/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/630844/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}